  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corridor for Growth -Transit Hubs Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Transit Hub project, implemented by Railway Children Africa under the Corridors for Growth (C4G) programme, strengthens safeguarding and protection systems within Tanzania&#x2019;s major transport hubs by integrating child- and vulnerable-person protection into national policies, establishing and operating Social Welfare Service Desks in bus terminals, building frontline capacity, and enhancing community awareness&#x2014;resulting in improved safety, coordinated response mechanisms, and increased support for vulnerable children and adults across transit environments.</narrative>
  </description>
